- Symptom: every commit, local and from CI, was authored by `RAiNBOW Bot
  <rainbow@example.com>` / `rainbow-bot <rainbow-bot@users.noreply.github.com>`.
- Fix: repository and global git identity set to
  `quxianp <quxianp@users.noreply.github.com>` (the account behind the remote
